=head2 tap

  $dom = $dom->tap(sub {...});

Alias for L<Mojo::Base/"tap">.

=head2 text

  my $text = $dom->text;

Extract text content from this element only (not including child elements).

  # "bar"
  $dom->parse("<div>foo<p>bar</p>baz</div>")->at('p')->text;

  # "foo\nbaz\n"
  $dom->parse("<div>foo\n<p>bar</p>baz\n</div>")->at('div')->text;

