  $dom->parse('<div>Hello</div>')->at('div')
    ->append_content($dom->new_tag('b', 'Mojo!'))->root;

=head2 next

  my $sibling = $dom->next;

Return L<Mojo::DOM> object for next sibling element, or C<undef> if there are no more siblings.

