=head2 from_hash

  $headers = $headers->from_hash({'Cookie' => 'a=b'});
  $headers = $headers->from_hash({'Cookie' => ['a=b', 'c=d']});
  $headers = $headers->from_hash({});

Parse headers from a hash reference, an empty hash removes all headers.

=head2 header

