  # "isabel"
  Mojo::URL->new('http://isabel:s3cret@mojolicious.org')->username;

=head1 OPERATORS

L<Mojo::URL> overloads the following operators.

=head2 bool

  my $bool = !!$url;

Always true.

=head2 stringify

  my $str = "$url";

Alias for L</"to_string">.

=head1 SEE ALSO

L<Mojolicious>, L<Mojolicious::Guides>, L<https://mojolicious.org>.

