Same as L</"start">, but performs all requests non-blocking and returns a L<Mojo::Promise> object instead of accepting
a callback.

  my $tx = $ua->build_tx(GET => 'http://example.com');
  $ua->start_p($tx)->then(sub ($tx) {
    say $tx->result->body;
