=head2 websocket_p

  my $promise = $ua->websocket_p('ws://example.com');

Same as L</"websocket">, but returns a L<Mojo::Promise> object instead of accepting a callback.

  $ua->websocket_p('wss://example.com/echo')->then(sub ($tx) {
