Base64 encoded in HMAC-SHA256 signed cookies, to prevent tampering. Note that cookies usually have a C<4096> byte
(4KiB) limit, depending on browser.

  # Manipulate session
  $c->session->{foo} = 'bar';
  my $foo = $c->session->{foo};
  delete $c->session->{foo};

