=head1 DESCRIPTION

L<Mojolicious::Routes::Route> is the route container used by L<Mojolicious::Routes>.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES

L<Mojolicious::Routes::Route> implements the following attributes.

=head2 children

  my $children = $r->children;
